Package: zypper-declarative
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Declarative, reconciling converger surfaced as a zypper subcommand
 zypper-declarative converges a SUSE system to a desired manifest (the
 declarable subset of the SUSE Machinery system description: packages,
 repositories, services, config_files) inside a single snapshot transaction,
 recording what was applied. It provides the verbs apply, diff, verify, status,
 and describe. Idempotent: a second run against an unchanged manifest and an
 undrifted system makes no changes.
